{"seq":1,"slug":"collections-algorithms","title":"集合与算法库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/core-libraries/collections-algorithms","wordCount":1142,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"集合与算法库\">集合与算法库</h1><p>Dart 的集合系统分为两层：<code>dart:core</code> 提供 List、Set、Map 三大基础类型及其字面量语法；<code>dart:collection</code> 提供高级数据结构如 LinkedList、SplayTreeMap、Queue 和 HashMap 的底层实现。两层共同通过 <code>Iterable</code> 协议统一，使得所有集合都能使用链式函数式操作。理解集合的接口层次、性能特征和惰性求值机制，是编写高效 Dart 程序的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>先立起本篇的几张底牌，后文所有论证都围绕它们展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>一句话定义</th>\n<th>在本篇中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>两层划分</td>\n<td><code>dart:core</code> 三大基础类型 + <code>dart:collection</code> 高级结构</td>\n<td>集合系统的整体骨架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Iterable 协议</td>\n<td>所有集合统一的迭代抽象</td>\n<td>链式函数式操作的公共入口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>惰性求值</td>\n<td><code>map</code>/<code>where</code> 等返回惰性 Iterable，迭代时才计算</td>\n<td>内存从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\times k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字面量控制流</td>\n<td><code>if</code>/<code>for</code>/<code>...</code> 可内嵌于集合字面量</td>\n<td>语言级而非库级的表达能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不可变包装</td>\n<td><code>const</code>、<code>unmodifiable</code>、<code>filled</code> 三类不同约束</td>\n<td>编译期与运行时两种不可变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复杂度选择</td>\n<td>按查找、插入、排序需求匹配数据结构</td>\n<td>性能调优的决策依据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话串起来：Iterable 协议统一了所有集合的消费方式，惰性求值让管道不产生中间列表，字面量控制流与不可变包装决定数据的构造方式，复杂度表决定选哪个结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"集合类型层次\">集合类型层次</h2><p>Dart 的集合接口形成了一个清晰的继承树：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Iterable] --&gt; B[List]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Set]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Queue]&#10;    E[Map] --&gt; F[HashMap]&#10;    E --&gt; G[LinkedHashMap]&#10;    E --&gt; H[SplayTreeMap]&#10;    B --&gt; I[固定长度 List]&#10;    B --&gt; J[可增长 List]&#10;    C --&gt; K[HashSet]&#10;    C --&gt; L[LinkedHashSet]&#10;    C --&gt; M[SplayTreeSet]&#10;    D --&gt; N[ListQueue]&#10;    D --&gt; O[DoubleLinkedQueue]\">graph TD\n    A[Iterable] --&gt; B[List]\n    A --&gt; C[Set]\n    A --&gt; D[Queue]\n    E[Map] --&gt; F[HashMap]\n    E --&gt; G[LinkedHashMap]\n    E --&gt; H[SplayTreeMap]\n    B --&gt; I[固定长度 List]\n    B --&gt; J[可增长 List]\n    C --&gt; K[HashSet]\n    C --&gt; L[LinkedHashSet]\n    C --&gt; M[SplayTreeSet]\n    D --&gt; N[ListQueue]\n    D --&gt; O[DoubleLinkedQueue]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>集合类型</th>\n<th>有序</th>\n<th>唯一性</th>\n<th>索引访问</th>\n<th>插入复杂度</th>\n<th>查找复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>List</code></td>\n<td>是（插入顺序）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>尾部 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，中间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>LinkedHashSet</code></td>\n<td>是（插入顺序）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>HashSet</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SplayTreeSet</code></td>\n<td>是（排序）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>LinkedHashMap</code></td>\n<td>是（插入顺序）</td>\n<td>键唯一</td>\n<td>按键 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SplayTreeMap</code></td>\n<td>是（键排序）</td>\n<td>键唯一</td>\n<td>按键 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ListQueue</code></td>\n<td>是（FIFO）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>头尾 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>默认选择：<code>List</code> 的字面量 <code>[]</code> 创建可增长的 ArrayList（内部数组，按需 2 倍扩容）；<code>Set</code> 字面量 <code>{}</code> 创建 <code>LinkedHashSet</code>；<code>Map</code> 字面量 <code>{}</code> 创建 <code>LinkedHashMap</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"集合字面量与控制流操作符\">集合字面量与控制流操作符</h2><p>Dart 集合字面量支持内嵌控制流——这是语言级别的特性，不是库方法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 条件插入&#10;final permissions = [&#10;  &#39;read&#39;,&#10;  if (isAdmin) &#39;write&#39;,&#10;  if (isAdmin &amp;&amp; isSuperAdmin) &#39;delete&#39;,&#10;];&#10;&#10;// 循环展开&#10;final squares = [&#10;  for (var i = 1; i &lt;= 10; i++) i * i,&#10;];&#10;&#10;// 展开操作符&#10;final combined = [...baseItems, ...extraItems];&#10;&#10;// Dart 3.8 空感知元素&#10;String? middleName = getMiddleName();&#10;final names = [firstName, ?middleName, lastName];&#10;&#10;// 嵌套集合构建&#10;final matrix = [&#10;  for (var row = 0; row &lt; 3; row++)&#10;    [for (var col = 0; col &lt; 3; col++) row * 3 + col],&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 条件插入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final permissions = [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  'read',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (isAdmin) 'write',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (isAdmin &#x26;&#x26; isSuperAdmin) 'delete',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 循环展开</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final squares = [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for (var i = 1; i &#x3C;= 10; i++) i * i,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 展开操作符</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final combined = [...baseItems, ...extraItems];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Dart 3.8 空感知元素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>String? middleName = getMiddleName();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final names = [firstName, ?middleName, lastName];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 嵌套集合构建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final matrix = [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for (var row = 0; row &#x3C; 3; row++)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [for (var col = 0; col &#x3C; 3; col++) row * 3 + col],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>];</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"iterable-协议与惰性求值\">Iterable 协议与惰性求值</h2><p><code>Iterable</code> 是 Dart 集合系统的核心抽象。关键特性：<code>map</code>、<code>where</code>、<code>expand</code> 等转换方法返回<strong>惰性 Iterable</strong>——不立即计算，只在迭代时逐个产出元素：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"final numbers = List.generate(1000000, (i) =&gt; i);&#10;&#10;// 惰性管道：即使源有百万元素，也不会创建中间列表&#10;final result = numbers&#10;    .where((n) =&gt; n.isEven)           // 惰性过滤&#10;    .map((n) =&gt; n * n)                // 惰性映射&#10;    .takeWhile((n) =&gt; n &lt; 1000000)    // 惰性截断&#10;    .toList();                        // 终止操作：触发计算&#10;&#10;// 对比：非惰性操作会创建中间结果&#10;// 如果你在每步之间调用 .toList()，会分配多个临时列表\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>final numbers = List.generate(1000000, (i) => i);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 惰性管道：即使源有百万元素，也不会创建中间列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final result = numbers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .where((n) => n.isEven)           // 惰性过滤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .map((n) => n * n)                // 惰性映射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .takeWhile((n) => n &#x3C; 1000000)    // 惰性截断</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .toList();                        // 终止操作：触发计算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 对比：非惰性操作会创建中间结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 如果你在每步之间调用 .toList()，会分配多个临时列表</span></span></code></pre></div><p>惰性求值的内存复杂度差异：设源集合大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，链中有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个转换步骤：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>内存</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>非惰性（每步创建中间列表）</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>惰性（逐元素流过管道）</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{内存} = \\begin{cases} O(n \\times k) &amp; \\text{非惰性（每步创建中间列表）} \\\\ O(1) &amp; \\text{惰性（逐元素流过管道）} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">内存</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">非惰性（每步创建中间列表）</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">惰性（逐元素流过管道）</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意陷阱：惰性 Iterable 每次迭代都会<strong>重新计算</strong>。如果管道中有副作用或昂贵计算，应该用 <code>.toList()</code> 物化缓存结果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"不可变集合\">不可变集合</h2><p>Dart 提供多种创建不可变集合的方式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// const 编译期常量（完全不可变，相同内容共享实例）&#10;const primes = [2, 3, 5, 7, 11, 13];&#10;&#10;// List.unmodifiable：运行时不可变包装&#10;final readOnly = List.unmodifiable(mutableList);&#10;// readOnly.add(1); // 抛出 UnsupportedError&#10;&#10;// 固定长度列表&#10;final fixed = List.filled(10, 0); // 长度固定为 10&#10;// fixed.add(1); // 抛出 UnsupportedError&#10;&#10;// Map.unmodifiable / Set.unmodifiable&#10;final frozenMap = Map.unmodifiable({&#39;a&#39;: 1, &#39;b&#39;: 2});&#10;final frozenSet = Set.unmodifiable({1, 2, 3});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// const 编译期常量（完全不可变，相同内容共享实例）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const primes = [2, 3, 5, 7, 11, 13];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// List.unmodifiable：运行时不可变包装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final readOnly = List.unmodifiable(mutableList);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// readOnly.add(1); // 抛出 UnsupportedError</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 固定长度列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final fixed = List.filled(10, 0); // 长度固定为 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// fixed.add(1); // 抛出 UnsupportedError</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Map.unmodifiable / Set.unmodifiable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final frozenMap = Map.unmodifiable({'a': 1, 'b': 2});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final frozenSet = Set.unmodifiable({1, 2, 3});</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>创建方式</th>\n<th>修改时行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>const []</code></td>\n<td>编译错误</td>\n<td>编译期已知的配置数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>List.unmodifiable()</code></td>\n<td>运行时 UnsupportedError</td>\n<td>API 返回值防篡改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>List.filled(n, v)</code></td>\n<td>可改元素值，不可改长度</td>\n<td>固定大小缓冲区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>UnmodifiableListView()</code></td>\n<td>运行时 UnsupportedError</td>\n<td>暴露内部列表的只读视图</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"高级数据结构\">高级数据结构</h2><p><code>dart:collection</code> 提供了超出基础 List/Set/Map 的数据结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"import &#39;dart:collection&#39;;&#10;&#10;// SplayTreeMap：自平衡二叉搜索树，保持键有序&#10;final leaderboard = SplayTreeMap&lt;int, String&gt;(&#10;  (a, b) =&gt; b.compareTo(a), // 降序排列&#10;);&#10;leaderboard[95] = &#39;Alice&#39;;&#10;leaderboard[87] = &#39;Bob&#39;;&#10;leaderboard[92] = &#39;Carol&#39;;&#10;// 迭代按分数降序：95-&gt;92-&gt;87&#10;&#10;// Queue：双端队列（基于环形缓冲区）&#10;final taskQueue = Queue&lt;String&gt;();&#10;taskQueue.addLast(&#39;task1&#39;);&#10;taskQueue.addLast(&#39;task2&#39;);&#10;taskQueue.addFirst(&#39;urgent&#39;);&#10;final next = taskQueue.removeFirst(); // &#39;urgent&#39;&#10;&#10;// LinkedList：侵入式双向链表&#10;final class TaskEntry extends LinkedListEntry&lt;TaskEntry&gt; {&#10;  final String name;&#10;  TaskEntry(this.name);&#10;}&#10;final tasks = LinkedList&lt;TaskEntry&gt;();&#10;tasks.add(TaskEntry(&#39;compile&#39;));&#10;tasks.add(TaskEntry(&#39;test&#39;));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import 'dart:collection';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// SplayTreeMap：自平衡二叉搜索树，保持键有序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final leaderboard = SplayTreeMap&#x3C;int, String>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (a, b) => b.compareTo(a), // 降序排列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>leaderboard[95] = 'Alice';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>leaderboard[87] = 'Bob';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>leaderboard[92] = 'Carol';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 迭代按分数降序：95->92->87</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Queue：双端队列（基于环形缓冲区）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final taskQueue = Queue&#x3C;String>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>taskQueue.addLast('task1');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>taskQueue.addLast('task2');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>taskQueue.addFirst('urgent');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final next = taskQueue.removeFirst(); // 'urgent'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// LinkedList：侵入式双向链表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final class TaskEntry extends LinkedListEntry&#x3C;TaskEntry> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final String name;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  TaskEntry(this.name);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final tasks = LinkedList&#x3C;TaskEntry>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tasks.add(TaskEntry('compile'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tasks.add(TaskEntry('test'));</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"集合上的算法模式\">集合上的算法模式</h2><p>标准库结合扩展方法可实现常见算法模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"extension CollectionAlgorithms&lt;T&gt; on List&lt;T&gt; {&#10;  // 二分查找（要求列表已排序）&#10;  int binarySearch(T target, int Function(T, T) compare) {&#10;    var low = 0, high = length - 1;&#10;    while (low &lt;= high) {&#10;      final mid = (low + high) ~/ 2;&#10;      final cmp = compare(this[mid], target);&#10;      if (cmp == 0) return mid;&#10;      if (cmp &lt; 0) low = mid + 1;&#10;      else high = mid - 1;&#10;    }&#10;    return -1;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  // 分组&#10;  Map&lt;K, List&lt;T&gt;&gt; groupBy&lt;K&gt;(K Function(T) keyFn) {&#10;    final map = &lt;K, List&lt;T&gt;&gt;{};&#10;    for (final item in this) {&#10;      map.putIfAbsent(keyFn(item), () =&gt; []).add(item);&#10;    }&#10;    return map;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  // 分块&#10;  Iterable&lt;List&lt;T&gt;&gt; chunked(int size) sync* {&#10;    for (var i = 0; i &lt; length; i += size) {&#10;      yield sublist(i, (i + size).clamp(0, length));&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 使用示例&#10;final users = fetchUsers();&#10;final byDepartment = users.groupBy((u) =&gt; u.department);&#10;final batches = users.chunked(50); // 每 50 个一批\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>extension CollectionAlgorithms&#x3C;T> on List&#x3C;T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 二分查找（要求列表已排序）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int binarySearch(T target, int Function(T, T) compare) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var low = 0, high = length - 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    while (low &#x3C;= high) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final mid = (low + high) ~/ 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final cmp = compare(this[mid], target);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      if (cmp == 0) return mid;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      if (cmp &#x3C; 0) low = mid + 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      else high = mid - 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return -1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 分组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Map&#x3C;K, List&#x3C;T>> groupBy&#x3C;K>(K Function(T) keyFn) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final map = &#x3C;K, List&#x3C;T>>{};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (final item in this) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      map.putIfAbsent(keyFn(item), () => []).add(item);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return map;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 分块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Iterable&#x3C;List&#x3C;T>> chunked(int size) sync* {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (var i = 0; i &#x3C; length; i += size) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      yield sublist(i, (i + size).clamp(0, length));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 使用示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final users = fetchUsers();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final byDepartment = users.groupBy((u) => u.department);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final batches = users.chunked(50); // 每 50 个一批</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>package:collection</code> 提供了更多生产就绪的算法：<code>mergeSort</code>（稳定排序）、<code>binarySearch</code>、<code>PriorityQueue</code>（堆）、<code>CanonicalizedMap</code>（键规范化的 Map）等。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能调优实践\">性能调优实践</h2><p>集合操作的性能选择矩阵：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 频繁查找 → 用 Set 或 Map（O(1)）而非 List.contains（O(n)）&#10;final allowedIds = &lt;String&gt;{}; // HashSet&#10;// 而非 final allowedIds = &lt;String&gt;[]; + list.contains(id)&#10;&#10;// 频繁头部插入 → 用 Queue 而非 List&#10;final buffer = Queue&lt;int&gt;(); // O(1) addFirst/removeFirst&#10;// 而非 list.insert(0, value); // O(n)&#10;&#10;// 需要排序遍历 → 用 SplayTreeMap 而非排序后的 List&#10;final sorted = SplayTreeMap&lt;DateTime, Event&gt;(); // 自动维护排序&#10;&#10;// 大量字符串拼接 → 用 StringBuffer 而非 + 操作符&#10;final sb = StringBuffer();&#10;for (final line in lines) {&#10;  sb.writeln(line); // O(n) 总复杂度&#10;}&#10;// 而非 result += line; // O(n²) 总复杂度\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 频繁查找 → 用 Set 或 Map（O(1)）而非 List.contains（O(n)）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final allowedIds = &#x3C;String>{}; // HashSet</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 而非 final allowedIds = &#x3C;String>[]; + list.contains(id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 频繁头部插入 → 用 Queue 而非 List</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final buffer = Queue&#x3C;int>(); // O(1) addFirst/removeFirst</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 而非 list.insert(0, value); // O(n)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 需要排序遍历 → 用 SplayTreeMap 而非排序后的 List</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final sorted = SplayTreeMap&#x3C;DateTime, Event>(); // 自动维护排序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 大量字符串拼接 → 用 StringBuffer 而非 + 操作符</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final sb = StringBuffer();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>for (final line in lines) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  sb.writeln(line); // O(n) 总复杂度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 而非 result += line; // O(n²) 总复杂度</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>集合系统分两层：<code>dart:core</code> 的 List/Set/Map 与字面量语法，<code>dart:collection</code> 的 LinkedList、SplayTreeMap、Queue 等高级结构，二者通过 Iterable 协议统一。</li>\n<li>默认选择：<code>[]</code> 是可增长 ArrayList，<code>{}</code> 分别创建 LinkedHashSet 与 LinkedHashMap，都保持插入顺序。</li>\n<li>集合字面量内嵌 <code>if</code>/<code>for</code>/<code>...</code> 是语言级特性，Dart 3.8 的空感知元素进一步统一了可空值插入。</li>\n<li><code>map</code>/<code>where</code>/<code>expand</code> 返回惰性 Iterable，内存复杂度从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\times k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，但每次迭代都会重新计算，有副作用时应 <code>.toList()</code> 物化。</li>\n<li>不可变有三档：<code>const</code> 编译期错误、<code>unmodifiable</code> 运行时异常、<code>filled</code> 长度固定但元素可改。</li>\n<li>性能选择矩阵：频繁查找用 Set/Map、频繁头部插入用 Queue、需要排序遍历用 SplayTreeMap、大量拼接用 StringBuffer。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参阅 <a href=\"dart-io-networking\">IO 与网络编程</a> 了解如何在 IO 操作中高效使用集合缓冲区，以及 <a href=\"../async-concurrency/stream-reactive\">Stream 与响应式编程</a> 了解集合与 Stream 之间的转换模式。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"集合与算法库","id":"集合与算法库"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"集合类型层次","id":"集合类型层次"},{"level":2,"text":"集合字面量与控制流操作符","id":"集合字面量与控制流操作符"},{"level":2,"text":"Iterable 协议与惰性求值","id":"iterable-协议与惰性求值"},{"level":2,"text":"不可变集合","id":"不可变集合"},{"level":2,"text":"高级数据结构","id":"高级数据结构"},{"level":2,"text":"集合上的算法模式","id":"集合上的算法模式"},{"level":2,"text":"性能调优实践","id":"性能调优实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Isolate 并发模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/async-concurrency/isolate-concurrency"},"next":{"title":"IO 与网络编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/core-libraries/dart-io-networking"}}